        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "R5 (390 kΩ) — U4 IREF to GND"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The SSD1306 IREF current-setting resistor would be three orders of magnitude too low, likely causing excessive OLED segment current and brightness and potentially damaging the display driver or panel.",
      "confidence": 0.94
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Most connectivity and passive values match the specification, but R5 is implemented as 390 Ω in the design files while the spec requires 390 kΩ, which is a clear value anomaly."
}

